= Severing's Ban

In May Carl Severing, the Social Democratic interior minister of Prussia, bans the proletarian hundreds in Berlin, the Ruhr, Halle and the Prussian suburbs of Hamburg. The police are to break up their drills and take their rifles. In Saxony and Thuringia the governments leave them alone.

In the last week of May the Ruhr miners strike for wages that keep up with prices. Our members lead many of the strike committees.

- @defy: The hundreds march in Prussia anyway.
- @move: Move the hundreds and their rifles to Saxony and Thuringia.
- @strikes: Put the party behind the Ruhr wage strikes.

@defy
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Arrests in Berlin, and pride.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed formations.
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.against('uprising');
RG.district('berlin', {repression: 8, militancy: 5, loyalty: 4});
RG.ecci('bukharin', 4);
Q.e23_may = 1;
Q.spd_relation -= 6;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

The Berlin hundreds march through Wedding on a Sunday morning. The police arrest four hundred of them, and the rest learn to drill in the woods at night.

@move
subtitle: Prussia loses its hundreds; Saxony gains an army in windcheaters.
on-arrival: {!
var moved = 0;
['berlin', 'ruhr', 'halle', 'hamburg'].forEach(function (d) {
    var g = Q['district_' + d + '_guards'] * 0.4;
    moved += g;
    RG.district(d, {guards: -g});
});
RG.district('saxony', {guards: moved * 0.6 + 1});
RG.district('thuringia', {guards: moved * 0.4 + 0.5});
Q.e23_may = 2;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

In Prussia the hundreds become sports clubs and hiking societies. Their best men and their rifles go south by train, in rucksacks.

@strikes
subtitle: [? if lock_union_work = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Ruhr committees learn to trust us. The strike may spread.
choose-if: lock_union_work < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids working through the unions.
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.against('union_work');
RG.district('ruhr', {loyalty: 6, members: 0.06});
RG.spreadStrike('ruhr');
Q.e23_may = 3;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

The strike committees win a wage index in a dozen pits. For the first time since 1920 the party is the strongest force on them.
